## Summary
The Russian Ministry of Defense has reported a successful strike on a Ukrainian launch site for FP-5 Flamingo cruise missiles in the Kharkov Region. The announcement was accompanied by video footage of the strike.

## Key Points
- Russian military claims a successful strike on a Ukrainian cruise missile launch site
- The targeted facility was used for launching FP-5 Flamingo cruise missiles
- The strike took place in the Kharkov Region
- The report was issued by the Russian Ministry of Defense and included video evidence


